---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — SENSES"
  description="The terms and conditions for using the SENSES media discovery platform."
>
  <div class="pt-[var(--nav-height)] pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16">

      <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-senses-text text-3xl font-light mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-10">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">1. Acceptance</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            By accessing or using senses.dhurta.com, you agree to these Terms of Service.
            If you do not agree, please do not use the platform. These terms govern your access
            to and use of SENSES, including all media content, creator profiles, and platform features.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">2. The platform</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            SENSES is a curated media discovery platform. We provide:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-3">
            {[
              'Access to curated visual and audio media',
              'Creator profiles and attribution information',
              'Personal organisation tools (likes, saves, collections)',
              'Discovery features (search, explore, personalisation)',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-senses-text-3 text-sm">
                <span class="mt-1.5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-senses-border-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any feature at any time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">3. Permitted use</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            You may use SENSES for personal, non-commercial discovery and enjoyment.
            You may not:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {[
              'Reproduce, distribute, or commercially exploit platform content without appropriate licensing',
              'Scrape, mirror, or systematically download media or metadata',
              'Impersonate creators or misrepresent attribution',
              'Attempt to circumvent any technical measures of the platform',
              'Use the platform in any way that violates applicable laws',
            ].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-senses-text-3 text-sm">
                <span class="mt-1.5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-red-500/50 flex-shrink-0" />
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">4. Media licensing</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Each media item on SENSES carries its own license, set by the creator. The license type
            is displayed on every media page. Downloading or using media is subject to the specific
            license terms shown. SENSES does not grant any rights beyond what the creator's chosen
            license allows. See the <a href="/licensing" class="text-senses-accent hover:underline">Licensing guide</a> for details.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">5. User-generated content</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Comments and notes you write are stored locally in your browser and are not transmitted
            to our servers. You are solely responsible for the content of any notes or annotations
            you create.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">6. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The SENSES name, logo, design system, and platform code are owned by Dhurta.Org.
            Media content belongs to the respective creators. Nothing in these terms transfers
            any intellectual property rights to you.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">7. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            SENSES is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We do not warrant that the
            platform will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses. Your use of the platform
            is at your own risk.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, Dhurta.Org shall not be liable for any indirect,
            incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of SENSES.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">9. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We may update these terms. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes
            acceptance of the updated terms. Material changes will be reflected in the "Last updated"
            date above.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Questions about these terms? Email
            <a href="mailto:legal@senses.dhurta.com" class="text-senses-accent hover:underline">
              legal@senses.dhurta.com
            </a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
